WEBVTT

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:50.020
Go on.

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:53.150
I thought you'd probably come.

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:55.440
Eat.

00:01:56.610 --> 00:01:57.450
Yes?

00:01:57.530 --> 00:02:01.450
You're really nice, aren't you?

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:05.290
Eat!

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:18.970
It's so good!

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:41.490
I'm so full.

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:45.490
-Looks like you're done.
-Yes.

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:48.000
Here's your dessert.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:52.000
I'll eat anything.

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:55.000
Here.

00:02:56.960 --> 00:02:58.720
What is that?

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:05.760
This is...

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:07.270
Water.

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:08.850
What?

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:09.890
It's ten liters.

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:13.350
It's the minimum amount
of hydration you need.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.020
You want me to drink ten liters?

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:18.480
Not in your condition.

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:20.320
FRUCTOSE

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.490
Mix this in.

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:26.620
Fructose is a pure sweetener
refined from fruits.

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:28.830
It's about four kilos.

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:34.080
It's a lot, but its absorption
is second to none.

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:41.050
Your poison was neutralized
and you recovered.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:45.050
But your recovery is not complete.

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:48.470
Hey, that's dirty.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:52.480
Usually, protein and starch is ideal,

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:55.190
but there's no time.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:05.160
Fourteen kilograms

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:07.370
of sugar water.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:09.580
A miracle will happen.

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:18.800
<i>Inflicted by deadly poison,</i>

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:21.760
<i>the boy's body was weakened</i>
<i>to its utmost limits.</i>

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:27.720
<i>It was further burdened</i>
<i>by the fights that followed.</i>

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:31.390
<i>The liver, which is the body's storehouse,</i>

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:34.390
<i>also reached the last of its glycogen.</i>

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:40.780
<i>More and more abuse came from his fights,</i>

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:45.780
<i>and his muscle cells</i>
<i>were completely destroyed.</i>

00:04:47.570 --> 00:04:48.490
<i>Those cells</i>

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:51.450
<i>swore to get revenge.</i>

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:57.630
<i>Their revenge on future abuse...</i>

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.630
<i>In the future,</i>

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:05.170
<i>if the same situation arises...</i>

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:07.090
Amazing.

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:09.720
<i>...they will surely</i>
<i>overcome it on their own.</i>

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:15.980
<i>A non-human body bestowed by God.</i>

00:05:17.230 --> 00:05:20.650
<i>With this oath to God,</i>
<i>failure is not a possibility.</i>

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:31.490
<i>The boy's body is now undergoing</i>
<i>unprecedented super recovery.</i>

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:35.200
Really?

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:38.670
How weak you are.

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:42.000
Hunger, thirst,

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:43.670
desire.

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:47.680
You're overflowing with deficiencies.

00:05:50.390 --> 00:05:52.760
You can't control them.

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:55.180
No, you don't even try.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:56.810
You're weak.

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:03.190
You don't have the power
to control your urges.

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:06.280
You have no control.

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:10.450
What strength are humans capable of?

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:13.490
The history of fighting and martial arts

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:20.330
is a history in which we fight
against natural urges and instincts.

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:24.380
I'll gladly show you

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:28.510
<i>the true strength</i>
<i>that humans are capable of.</i>

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:33.760
It's a spectacle that's hard to believe.

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:37.480
Standing before us is Sea Emperor Kaku,

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:40.020
a master that represents China.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:43.820
It's a miracle that he's participating.

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:46.980
It's a miracle that he's even standing.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:49.490
It's hard to believe he's fighting!

00:06:52.990 --> 00:06:54.080
Begin!

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:01.370
It has begun! Sea Emperor versus Sea King!

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:04.040
This fight would normally

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:09.090
be a clear victory
for the higher-ranked Sea Emperor Kaku.

00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:11.090
However!

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:14.010
The age gap is a whopping 121 years!

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:17.970
Sea King Samwan is 25 years old.

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:20.020
At this age, he's full of promise.

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:24.770
<i>I have heard that Samwan's master,</i>
<i>Ryusho So,</i>

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:26.980
<i>went to Thailand 18 years ago.</i>

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:31.650
<i>His daily wages came from</i>
<i>winning cash in Muay Thai matches.</i>

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:39.160
<i>He witnessed a young Samwan</i>
<i>playing around with a cobra,</i>

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:41.790
<i>and that was the historic moment</i>

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:44.750
<i>when Chinese Kenpo</i>
<i>and Muay Thai met by chance.</i>

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:48.750
<i>Then he got lessons for ten years.</i>

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:51.880
<i>They both moved to Hong Kong.</i>

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:56.430
<i>He won all his Raitai matches.</i>

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:59.640
<i>A couple years ago,</i>
<i>the Chinese Ministry of Martial Arts</i>

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:04.310
<i>finally gave the title of Sea King</i>
<i>to Samwan of Thailand.</i>

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:08.320
Look at that!

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:10.280
He moved forward before we realized it.

00:08:10.940 --> 00:08:13.780
Sea Emperor Kaku still has his glasses on.

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:16.780
<i>It's not real.</i>

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:22.660
<i>Life force, breathing,</i> fa jin...

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.670
<i>It's all make-believe.</i>

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:30.800
<i>You call it martial arts, but it's all</i>
<i>just physical ability.</i>

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:35.300
<i>It's a world where you use</i>
<i>your body logically.</i>

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:38.800
<i>There's no magic there.</i>

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:40.430
<i>Faster...</i>

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:41.970
<i>Faster...</i>

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:43.480
<i>Faster!</i>

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:47.400
<i>And, with more speed.</i>

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:09.340
Flick!

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:19.930
It's over!

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:27.480
What? Bricks?

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:30.230
How could that break bricks?

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:35.490
It's just a finger flick.

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:41.160
Right?

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:45.000
You don't need power.

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:47.290
Hey.

00:09:51.130 --> 00:09:53.340
I'll excuse myself now.

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:58.010
You don't need power?

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:00.850
That's right. Women, children,

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:04.100
elderly people,
and those with similar physiques.

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:07.850
Those are the kinds of people
who need techniques.

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:13.690
What point is there in having

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:16.860
martial arts that weak people can't use?

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:21.820
Use the necessary technique
at the necessary time.

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:24.660
Use it at the necessary speed.

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:30.880
Control your emotions
and know your timing.

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:36.210
If you have the perfect timing
in your grasp...

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:40.510
even speed is no longer required.

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:45.390
That old geezer!

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:51.060
To think he'd do such a thing...

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:05.160
"After today, how could I possibly

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:10.330
show my face in Hong Kong?"

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:12.290
Was I right?

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:17.340
You bastard.

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:20.010
But jeez...

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:21.970
How unsightly.

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:25.430
If you were Japanese,

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:28.390
you'd perform <i>hara-kiri</i>
right then and there.

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:31.640
Hey.

00:11:32.480 --> 00:11:33.310
Don't!

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:38.190
Even if you lose,
there's a way to go about it.

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:42.360
"Should I keep living? Even tomorrow?"

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:46.620
If it were me, I couldn't...

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:57.960
You're inexperienced.

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:02.760
-Samwan!
-Samwan!

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:03.720
However,

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:06.180
you're not wrong.

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:14.480
Hey, isn't it...

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:16.770
kind of humid in here?

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:17.980
It is.

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:37.210
Master Retsu.

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:44.760
Master Retsu, what is this?

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:47.010
He's awakening.

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:50.350
"Awakening"?

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:56.270
Fourteen kilograms of sugar water.

00:12:57.480 --> 00:12:59.020
This mere sugar water

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:02.110
is restoring his devastated body.

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:05.780
This is how much his body was abused

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:09.030
while he was poisoned.

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:13.370
-Baki's body will be even more--
-Retsu!

00:13:34.600 --> 00:13:35.560
Hey.

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:47.700
Baki?

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:11.800
Retsu.

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:14.520
He has revived!

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:17.140
Baki Hanma has revived!

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:19.690
Baki Hanma has revived!

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:21.940
Baki Hanma has revived!

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:23.770
Baki Hanma has revived!

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:26.030
Baki Hanma has revived!

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:29.780
-Baki Hanma has revived!
-A fight.

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:32.200
I want to fight.

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:46.090
Sea King Dorian has arrived!

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:49.880
Isn't Dorian kind of...

00:14:50.260 --> 00:14:51.300
Is he possibly...

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:54.890
-He's not normal.
-Yes.

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:59.480
People don't usually eat candy
at the ring.

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:06.570
Sea King Yoh has arrived!

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:13.990
Now, go get him.

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:23.330
Begin!

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:46.360
Candy...

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:32.360
We have a winner!

00:16:35.320 --> 00:16:37.830
Wait, it's over already?

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:40.950
This is the incredible Great Raitai!

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:43.040
It was a one-sided match!

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:46.960
The opponent couldn't get in
a single counterattack.

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:50.550
It's hard to believe
they were both Sea Kings.

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:53.970
What a one-sided turn of events!

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:57.340
Usually...

00:16:57.550 --> 00:16:59.850
this Sea King Dorian

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:03.850
would not be considered
fit for the Raitai stage.

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:08.060
However, this is
the Great Raitai Tournament!

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:14.990
This is martial arts!

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:19.950
What?

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:22.490
He stood up!

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:25.830
He received such heavy damage,

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:29.500
yet he walks offstage on his own two feet.

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:36.130
This in itself can be considered
a sign of being a great martial artist.

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:51.520
I can't accept this.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:59.030
This Westerner has no right
to be called a Sea King!

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:00.870
So?

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:04.240
What will you do about it, Yoh?

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:09.290
Fight me again!

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:11.500
Come on, Yoh.

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:13.300
Don't be unreasonable.

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:14.550
It's unacceptable!

00:18:17.050 --> 00:18:19.300
I will never accept that
as his true strength.

00:18:21.390 --> 00:18:24.600
Yoh, would you be okay with
fighting me instead?

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:27.310
You?

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:31.810
As you've deduced, Dorian is sick.

00:18:40.070 --> 00:18:41.820
Is brute strength your specialty?

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:45.330
Yes, I only have brute strength.

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:55.840
<i>I can't open my fist.</i>

00:19:04.430 --> 00:19:07.640
So, do I meet your standards?

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:15.110
Go to the Raitai stage right now!

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:18.190
Certainly, sir.

00:19:18.280 --> 00:19:19.900
Roger that.

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:22.320
Thank you, Sea King Yoh.

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:44.430
Our sponsors
and the Chinese Ministry of Martial Arts

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:46.970
have an announcement for everyone.

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:51.640
Sea King Dorian's assistant,

00:19:52.140 --> 00:19:55.400
Biscuit Oliva,
has objected to the match results.

00:19:55.730 --> 00:19:59.110
He has a burning desire
to fight Sea King Yoh.

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:04.660
Contestant Yoh has agreed to this request.

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:09.620
Here, Kongoken user
Sea King Yoh will fight

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:12.330
Biscuit Oliva and his unrivaled strength.

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:16.170
A special match is now underway.

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:19.170
-This is interesting!
-You're awesome, Assistant!

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:21.670
Oliva, was it?

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:24.470
Can you make the first move?

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:26.430
What?

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:30.430
You claim to be
the strongest man in the world,

00:20:31.180 --> 00:20:32.680
but let me be honest.

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:37.360
There's too big of a gap
between our fighting abilities.

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:45.530
I use the Kongoken.

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:49.450
Its purpose is to make
our entire body into a diamond.

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:53.830
<i>We start by getting hit</i>
<i>with wooden swords.</i>

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:57.330
<i>Soon, we're struck by chains</i>

00:20:58.340 --> 00:21:01.340
<i>and get our abdomen</i>
<i>run over by large trucks.</i>

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:05.430
<i>And then we experience violent explosions</i>

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:07.840
<i>fired from old-school cannons.</i>

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:11.770
<i>And our final training</i>

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:15.310
<i>is held at the dead of night</i>
<i>during a typhoon.</i>

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:17.850
<i>We finish by bathing at the bottom</i>

00:21:18.360 --> 00:21:22.190
<i>of a 30-meter-tall waterfall until dawn.</i>

00:21:23.940 --> 00:21:25.240
Don't hold back.

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:28.070
Hit me as much as you want.

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:30.240
It seems like...

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:36.210
you're being
really considerate towards me.

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:39.130
I guess

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:43.840
my punches probably won't work on you.

00:21:45.220 --> 00:21:47.380
But it's such a great chance.

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:50.390
I'll kindly accept your offer.

00:21:56.390 --> 00:21:59.310
You're such an idiot.

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:13.660
I can't stop laughing!

00:22:14.790 --> 00:22:17.870
The diamond was crushed.

00:23:42.290 --> 00:23:43.210
IDIOTS FROM PLANET STRONG
